      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.71 (down from ₹1.03 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹13.4b (up 5.8% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹102.6m (down 31% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.8% (down from 1.2% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 33% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 1% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
